# Docker / data
infra/data/
pgdata/

# VPS-only TLS material. These live on the server and exist nowhere else: the
# origin certificate and key Caddy serves with. They must never be committed,
# and — more importantly — must never be treated as stale files to be cleaned
# away during a deploy. Losing them takes the site down until they are reissued.
infra/origin.crt
infra/origin.key

# Logs
*.log
.deploy-prev
